<title>UK: Slovenska Sporitelna sets $80 million 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Slovenska Sporitelna sets $80 million 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated step-up floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SLOVENSKA SPORITELNA</p>
<p> AMT    $80 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **20.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *1.25	PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BA1	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   75 BP</p>
<p> REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES     *STEPS-UP TO 3M-LIBOR +300 BP AFTER FIVE YEARS.</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE FROM YEAR FIVE AT PAR.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SLK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SLOVAKIA  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
